{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2d21e691fc32b42e3720b53d63b1c0c42244e11d612f6038074fc0bb4d060707", "ja": "（ライブのために、麗花たちとハワイまでやってきた。\nハワイの海に、麗花は目を輝かせている）", "zh": "（为了演出，我和丽花她们来到了夏威夷。看到夏威夷的海，丽花眼睛都亮了起来）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "2abcfa74cf86a9310cad30606b6de481dea5fa31ca805e22eef7fa4c95b573a0", "ja": "わあ～、見てください{$P$}さん！\nすっごく海ですよ！　泳いだら日本に着くかな？", "zh": "哇～，快看快看，{$P$}先生！\n好大一片海啊！游过去能到日本吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "ecc10335ee0f25b6f6c054f6ec27772749d3b8a4a305a98bd26f31dee539a9ef", "ja": "私、泳げるところまで泳いでみたいです！\nちょっと水着になってきてもいいですか！？", "zh": "我想游到能游的最远处！\n我去换一下泳衣可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1003_p", "source_sha256": "132e6851d623860e1e9855005a9db2c6753abcda4df64bf4a72beb1d18648835", "ja": "気持ちはわかるけど、まずはライブの準備をしような。\n遊ぶ時間もちゃんと確保してるから、安心してくれ。", "zh": "我能理解你的心情，不过还是先准备演出吧。\n玩耍的时间也会好好留出来的，放心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "243f8fb0f66b7ce3ebea4a55320d2fd2b6f88b22ef938f8c2663972ee2102314", "ja": "あっ、ライブで来たんでしたね！　なんだか\n{$P$}さんはカレンダーですね！", "zh": "啊，我们是为了演唱会来的呢！总觉得，\n{$P$}先生就像日历一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d41cc42946fce2201051846ee119848f3afe92fec64889ba50d17318901293be", "ja": "カレンダー……予定を把握してるからか？\nとにかく、仕事で来てることを忘れないでくれよ。", "zh": "日历……是因为我掌握着行程吗？总之，别忘了我是来工作的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "977aadef1189343604fdfca047b32ffefd29deda0a159b69c3f6c5c24a82722f", "ja": "はーい！　でもでも、ハワイといえば、やっぱり\n海でバカンス！　浜辺でドライブだと思うんです。", "zh": "好——！不过不过，说到夏威夷，果然还是要去海边度假！我觉得还得在海滩边兜兜风。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "9fbb08eff15fdbaf1911084b487d7aa673e091fd2f9ccfdcc2ce09f741a61106", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、お仕事が終わったら\nみんなと一緒に遊びましょうね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生在工作结束之后，\n也和大家一起去玩吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8f3b17df0ff967237c8ae4beeb51956d8e9614ba61a2eafb78a2d469c6e3abe5", "ja": "ああ、時間があったら是非……とはいえやることも\n多いからなぁ。", "zh": "啊，要是有时间当然愿意……不过要做的事情也很多啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "cee8fae2085f75eb822876093478275ae15d75f849ba6cb0c3aa6d3aef6297b9", "ja": "えっ、遊ぶ時間も確保してるって言いましたよね？\nカレンデューサーさん、間違えちゃったんですか！？", "zh": "诶？你刚才不是说也确保了玩耍的时间吗？\n日程制作人先生，您是不是搞错了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e3017a42f6afc93cf8bb1ae364d0f82d06fff2ca2ef28edc902c2e367c2fe5b2", "ja": "えっ？　確保してあるのは麗花たちのオフの話で、\n俺に時間があるかは別の話だよ。", "zh": "咦？我说的是已经安排好了丽花她们的休息时间，至于我有没有时间，那是另一回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "277ac4e7cdf74c9376690d9b02b55c7776844e433fe0be1b56325ff9d1abfcd5", "ja": "ええー！　せっかくのハワイなのにもったいないです！\nこんなに海もハワイ！で、空気もハワイ！なのにー！", "zh": "诶——！难得来到夏威夷，不好好享受就太浪费了！明明大海是夏威夷，空气也是夏威夷——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "028af6ea91d0f1bc5dc37d191725f8e096b20337a354e1414cd08a04f7f9a50b", "ja": "私もお手伝いしますから、何でも言ってくださいね！\nなにをすればいいですか？　専属運転手ですか？", "zh": "我也会来帮忙的，有什么事尽管吩咐！\n要我做什么呢？当您的专属司机吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d3ce23866b11b518ed10f21254447549eed7b073a93f7293d6ff3e1b03c3cabf", "ja": "そうだな。麗花にしてもらいたいことは……。", "zh": "是啊……我想让丽花做的事是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_1014", "source_sha256": "f1db959523eff8af16e5d647809e8f4bc4ec39dbdfad0d27064626481e6ee170", "ja": "ライブに集中！", "zh": "专心演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_2000_p", "source_sha256": "3efb189c92611fb196abcd535cc6a0b3ada343b9a1edd24f488abb3908c6e064", "ja": "さっきも言ったけど、ライブを大成功させること！\nそれが一番重要だからな。", "zh": "刚才也说过了，要让演出大获成功！\n这才是最重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_2001_048rei", "source_sha256": "5763e8192731c6500e5964e346c8c0e7551317a930ceb1e1a2aba6fde97bcd11", "ja": "……それでいいんですか？\n私、最初からそのつもりでしたよ？", "zh": "……这样就可以了吗？\n我从一开始就是这么打算的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_2002_048rei", "source_sha256": "ceb9fdcfa8c9e5e368ab85dfb2a1574951a1c51e494aa32eaa9c9dee0f8ab8e2", "ja": "じゃあ、カレンダーに追加しちゃいますね♪\n{$P$}さんと遊ぶ……うん、完璧♪", "zh": "那我就加到日历上啦♪\n和{$P$}先生一起玩……嗯，完美♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0513_2003_p", "source_sha256": "ac5253fb88c687adadb6c733122268d0fddb06dc1039024ad1975b3caa074d60", "ja": "（その後、ライブは成功。遊ぶ時間もできて、\n常夏のハワイでの仕事、いい息抜きになったな……）", "zh": "（之后，演唱会顺利结束，也有了玩耍的时间。在盛夏的夏威夷工作，真是一次很好的放松……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
